@startuml R4_Package_Web
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 260
skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 12
}
title UML package diagram: web client (apps/web/src)
package "Application shell\nmain.tsx, App.tsx" as N0
package "routes\napp-routes.tsx (lazy-loaded pages)" as N1
package "layouts\nMainLayout, AdminLayout" as N2
package "pages\nroute components" as N3
package "features\nacademic-profile, admin, analytics, auth, bookmarks, compare, contributions, credits, docs, forum, gap-closure, gaps, home, literature, manuscripts, notifications, papers, projects, reports, reviews, search, submissions, trends, user-ai" as N4
package "components\nshared UI (shadcn-style)" as N5
package "Foundation\nservices (api-client, query-client), stores (Zustand), hooks, utils, constants, i18n, theme" as N6
package "@trend/shared-types\npackages/shared-types" as N7
rectangle "Backend API\n[HTTP /api/v1]\ncalled by services/api-client (axios)" as N8
N0 ..> N1 : "«use»"
N1 ..> N2 : "«use»"
N1 ..> N3 : "«use»"
N3 <..> N4 : "252 / 7"
N4 <..> N5 : "293 / 5"
N5 ..> N6 : "«use» (all layers)"
N4 ..> N7 : "217 files"
N6 --> N8 : "axios"
legend bottom
Pair labels: import statements per direction (non-test, origin/main). Pages and features also import Foundation directly; pages import components (190); layouts import components (8) and features (6). Blue = web, grey = shared / external.
endlegend
@enduml
